    "summary": "Story board (battle) made of wood. Depicts a water battle in canoes, thought to be a historical event. Central vessel with warrior in foreground; surrounded by red-hulled canoes of warriors wielding spears. Spears shown in the air; a central pair crossing paths. Canoe hulls on left and in centre are decorated with pattern of human heads; canoes on the right are decorated with birds. Trees, houses (bai) and platforms at water&#039;s edge.",
